From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 07:31:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Add comprehensive CLI launcher and monitor for complete
 Ponyou management

Implements unified Claude Code-style CLI system with 3 new tools:

1. ponyou-launcher.js - Main control center with 9 menu options:
   - Start Agent with pre-flight validation
   - Dashboard (real-time auto-refresh)
   - Comprehensive Monitor (detailed metrics)
   - Advanced Configuration (8 sections)
   - LLM Provider Management (9 providers)
   - System Testing and Validation
   - Documentation & Help
   - File Manager (view config files)
   - Exit

2. ponyou-monitor.js - Comprehensive monitoring dashboard:
   - Status overview (trading status, positions, mode)
   - Trading performance (win rate, P&L, consecutive wins)
   - Risk metrics (max drawdown, Sharpe ratio, risk score)
   - Configuration summary (provider, capital, strategy)
   - Learning system (active lessons, top performers)
   - Recent trades (last 5 trades)
   - Open positions (current holdings with P&L)
   - Auto-refresh every 5 seconds
   - Detailed statistical analysis

3. PONYOU-CLI-COMPLETE.md - Complete documentation:
   - Quick start guide for all 3 options
   - Detailed menu flows and options
   - Command reference for all tools
   - Configuration file documentation
   - Troubleshooting guide
   - Typical usage workflows

Features:
- Single entry point (ponyou-launcher.js)
- Interactive menu-driven interface
- Real-time monitoring with color-coded metrics
- Complete integration with all existing tools
- Pre-flight validation before starting agent
- File management capabilities
- System testing integration
- Comprehensive metric analysis (Sharpe, drawdown, etc)
- Learning system tracking
- Position-level P&L display

This creates a complete "Claude Code for Ponyou" experience,
enabling full remote management of the trading agent from CLI
without needing to edit code or access files directly.

